      "title": "UK to force Apple and Google to block explicit images on children’s smartphones",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/technology/2026/sep/08/uk-apple-google-explicit-images-children-smartphones-lisa-nandy-legislation",
      "description": "<p>Lisa Nandy says government will introduce legislation after talks end without breakthrough</p><p>Apple and Google will be forced to block explicit images on children’s smartphones by law in the UK after talks failed to produce a breakthrough, the government has said.</p><p>The legislation commitment puts ministers on a collision course with two of the biggest players in Silicon Valley, months after the government announced a social media ban for under-16s.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/technology/2026/sep/08/uk-apple-google-explicit-images-children-smartphones-lisa-nandy-legislation\">Continue reading...</a>",
